{
  "name": "Musician",
  "system": {
    "origin": "Class Rework",
    "effect": "Effect: You may use Musician Songs.\nBonus: You gain the Ability @UUID[Compendium.ptu.abilities.Item.CLHnXbO5J6lson7C]{Drown Out}.\n\nMechanic: Songs – Musician Songs can be triggered one of four ways. Regardless of the Area of Effect, Songs always affect the user.\n- When using a Move with the Sonic keyword, Songs may be triggered as a Rapid Action, and the Song’s Area of Effect is the same as the triggering Move’s.\n- When using a Dance Move, Songs may be triggered as a Shift Action with an Area of Effect of Burst 2.\n- As a Standard Action, you may trigger one Song, with an Area of Effect of Burst 4.\n- As a Full Action, you may trigger two Songs, each with an Area of Effect of Burst 4.\n@UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.9Z21sxI6QAsDVudC]{Song of Courage}\n@UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.N5mM55wNX61mTimc]{Song of Might}\n@UUID[Compendium.ptu.moves.Item.AbMrFjiw5lueLUzm]{Song of Life}",
